WEBVTT

1
00:00:56,080 --> 00:00:57,280
She is afraid of jellyfish poison

2
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:58,510
She's avoiding the jellyfish

3
00:00:58,510 --> 00:01:00,510
From submerged reefs beneath your feet to jellyfish swarms

4
00:01:00,510 --> 00:01:01,510
About ten meters

5
00:01:01,510 --> 00:01:03,110
Follow the jellyfish swarm as a barrier

6
00:01:03,110 --> 00:01:04,910
You can float all the way to the island.

7
00:01:04,910 --> 00:01:06,510
This is my only way to survive

8
00:01:06,510 --> 00:01:24,140
If you wait any longer, you will die.
